  "name": "etl.postProcessing.job",
  "summary": "Hourly ETL watchdog: check each ETL upload's state and notify/slack/skip accordingly.",
  "description": "Scheduled watchdog for the SEMS nightly ETL uploads (IC/student and Address). Reads a run-state row per ETL type (did it run, delayed, failed, skipped, or no file today) with all decisions precomputed as flags, then per type: calls the existing notifier (etl.postParsing.execute) for completed/failed uploads to send the log email; sends the 'no file today' email when nothing arrived; Slacks the team on delay/failure; marks SHOULD-NOT-RUN records as SKIPPED. Replaces etl.address.scheduler.postProcess. Input: optional uploadId (v1 runs the scheduled all-types scan for today). Output: status.",
